## Laboratory Safety Rules  


Handle all apparatus and chemicals carefully and correctly. Always check the label on the container before using the substance it contains. Do not taste any chemical unless otherwise instructed by the teacher. Do not eat, drink or play in the laboratory. Do not tamper with the electrical mains and other fittings in the laboratory. Never work with electricity near water. Don't place flammable substance near naked flames. Wash your hands after all laboratory work.  


