================================================================================

In this case, the bus is in stable equilibrium. If the same bus is loaded with steel sheets on the top, the centre of gravity be raised. It is now near to a state of unstable equilibrium. A couple will turn it over if it is slightly tilted. The same is the case of ships and boats. We can improve the stability of a system either by lowering the centre of gravity or by widening the base.  


