The concept of stability is widely applied to engineering technology especially in manufacturing racing cars and balancing toys.  

As the racing cars are driven at very high speeds and also there are sharp turns in the track, therefore, the chances of the cars to topple over increase. To enhance the stability of racing cars, their centres of mass are kept as low as possible. There base areas are also increased by keeping the wheel outside of their main bodies. Balancing toys are also very interesting for both children and elders. Look at some balancing toys shown below.  

